  "data": {
    "body": "This figure shows a system consisting of a positive and negative charge at an instant of time. As usual, we have drawn an oval around those charges to distinguish the system from objects in the system's surroundings. In this case, the only other object near enough to interact significantly with the system is another negative charge. All three charges have the same magnitude Q.\n\nWhich of the following statements best describes the net force exerted on the system in this situation?",
